# `before` lives at top-level -- prints live.
before
# First `>` after the bare name SomeTable engages MnemoAnalysis `>`.
MnemoAnalysis > <
# Each row's close `}` routes Root to ListAfterClose, which matches `>`
# for "another row" -- the multi-row continuation we fixed.
ListAfterClose >
ListAfterClose >
# After the last row's `}`, the next non-`>` token routes the else.
ListAfterClose else -> Root
# `after` lives at top-level again -- prints live.
after
End of program
# Row body Cons.OutLn calls do NOT print live: they're inside the
# sub-cap that ListAfter `{` opened, so they queue as IPs in IcStack.
! row a
! row b
! row c
